  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday through Sunday)\nIssued at 1223 PM CDT Sun Aug 23 2026\n\nExtensive cloud cover and ongoing precip will influence\ntemperature trends Monday with a large range in temps likely\nacross the forecast area by afternoon. Heat advisories may be\nneeded for portions of the area as confidence increases in\ntemperature trends. \n\nHot temperatures are more likely across a larger portion of the\narea on Tuesday ahead of the next weak cold front. Blended\nguidance favors a minor cool down by Wednesday with very low\nprecip chances across the region. Any cool down will likely be\nbrief with hot temperatures expanding area wide by late week.\nOverall precip chances remain low beyond Monday and the lack of\nwidespread beneficial rainfall will drive localized fire weather\nconcerns through the week.",
